## 6. СЦЕНАРИИ ИНТЕГРАЦИИ

### 6.1. Сценарий 1: Получение состояния пользователя

```
1. FRONTEND → API Gateway: GET /api/v4/state?user_id={id}&date={date}
2. API Gateway → Psychometry Service: GET /api/v4/state?user_id={id}&date={date}
3. Psychometry → PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM psych.mmpi_results WHERE user_id = {id} ORDER BY completed_at DESC LIMIT 1
4. Psychometry → Forecast Service: GET /api/v3/forecast?user_id={id}&date={date}
5. Psychometry → Astro Service: GET /internal/v4/users/{id}/biorhythms?date={date}
6. Psychometry → Alignment Engine: GET /api/v4/alignment/coherence?user_id={id}&date={date}
7. Psychometry → MinIO: PUT /processed/states/year={year}/month={month}/day={day}/user_{id}_{timestamp}.parquet
8. Psychometry → Redis: SET state:{user_id}:{date} {state_data} EX 300
9. Psychometry → API Gateway → FRONTEND: { state: {...} }
```

### 6.2. Сценарий 2: Прохождение MMPI

```
1. FRONTEND → API Gateway: POST /api/v4/mmpi
2. API Gateway → Psychometry Service: POST /api/v4/mmpi
3. Psychometry → Astro Service: GET /internal/v4/users/{id}/biorhythms?date={date}
4. Psychometry → Forecast Service: GET /api/v3/forecast?user_id={id}&date={date}
5. Psychometry → PostgreSQL: INSERT INTO psych.mmpi_results ...
6. Psychometry → MinIO: PUT /raw/mmpi/year={year}/month={month}/day={day}/user_{id}_{timestamp}.parquet
7. Psychometry → Alignment Engine: (опционально) GET /api/v4/alignment/coherence?user_id={id}&date={date}
8. Psychometry → Event Bus: publish mmpi.completed event
9. Psychometry → API Gateway → FRONTEND: { success: true, scores: {...} }
```

### 6.3. Сценарий 3: Обратная связь

```
1. FRONTEND → API Gateway: POST /api/v4/feedback
2. API Gateway → Psychometry Service: POST /api/v4/feedback
3. Psychometry → PostgreSQL: INSERT INTO psych.feedback ...
4. Psychometry → MinIO: PUT /analytics/feedback/year={year}/month={month}/day={day}/user_{id}_{timestamp}.parquet
5. Psychometry → Event Bus: publish feedback.received event
6. Psychometry → API Gateway → FRONTEND: { success: true }
7. Analytics Worker → Event Bus: consume feedback.received
8. Analytics Worker → PostgreSQL: UPDATE psych.feedback_aggregates ...
9. Analytics Worker → Psychometry Service: (если нужно) POST /api/v4/config/update
```

### 6.4. Сценарий 4: Калибровка весов

```
1. ADMIN → Final Tuner: POST /api/v4/tuner/weights/optimize/family
2. Final Tuner → Analytics Worker: GET /api/v4/analytics/feedback/aggregates?category=family
3. Final Tuner → MinIO: GET /analytics/feedback/year=*/month=*/day=*/*.parquet
4. Final Tuner → PostgreSQL: INSERT INTO tuner.weight_optimizations ...
5. Final Tuner → MinIO: PUT /analytics/calibrations/calibration_v1.parquet
6. ADMIN → Final Tuner: POST /api/v4/tuner/apply
7. Final Tuner → Psychometry Service: POST /api/v4/config/apply
8. Psychometry Service → PostgreSQL: UPDATE psych.achievement_indices SET weights = {...}
9. ADMIN → FINAL TUNER: { success: true, applied: true }
```

